# qmldir — explicit module manifest for quickshell/modules/ (D-12, closes FM1)
#
# Checking this file in disables Quickshell's directory-scanner synthesis for
# this directory entirely (verified via `quickshell -p ... -v -v`: an
# unmodified tree's `Scanning directory ".../modules"` trace synthesizes
# exactly this file — `module qs.modules` header plus one `Name Version
# File.qml` line per local type). Any .qml type added to this directory that
# is NOT declared below becomes unresolvable to `shell.qml`'s
# `import "modules"` — Phase 12-06 added Colours.qml/Motion.qml here in the
# same commit that created them, per this file's own standing instruction.
# Any FUTURE type added to this directory MUST do the same.
module qs.modules
Colours 1.0 Colours.qml
Motion 1.0 Motion.qml
Probe 1.0 Probe.qml
ScreencopyProbe 1.0 ScreencopyProbe.qml
